{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:22 2026-05-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:22 2026-05-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:22 2026-05-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"「白鷺金剛」勝出今屆打吡大賽，馬主白鷺團體昨晚擺慶功宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/cd15699d117c7c3118eb8d6652ca12d6/2026-05/c1_3.jpg\"/><p>廖廄「白鷺金剛」勝出今屆打吡大賽，馬主白鷺團體昨晚擺慶功宴，除宴請布文、廖康銘及其香港與從化兩地馬房員工外，馬會行政總裁應家柏亦有出席，並且齊齊大合照，場面相當熱鬧。</p><p>「白鷺金剛」在布文胯下於今屆打吡力壓「數字天文」及「紫荊盛勢」兩匹羅廄馬奪魁，也是廖康銘在港從練以來首次勝出打吡。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cae3c248330fe2bf4fa00c0c2fb26df3/2026-05/9b6a10e6-1698-4626-842f-1d5c33dd2a47.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0aab3df8982cc45d8d281bfd2bbc519/2026-05/86e473af-7bae-44ca-80cd-d2fb27f65499.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c92cce638f706351d52afa831b921eda/2026-05/387b1fd0-b293-4723-a609-234878770174.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a129c2a6c8e2dc9182631db1b0bad72/2026-05/13695af8-abae-4784-a02b-3cda3b989c59.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ff216f551d1b8ad44c23bbe0b9e0f1e/2026-05/26881203-e0f1-43a8-b635-8a40864e325a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae40aeb19750fa5e2eb08fa2e9e6bbd7/2026-05/a1ae5832-1e7f-4186-bdc0-51de397ca6bc.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89affcea9818ec5d75aaed967f2487c4/2026-05/f62dfe69-8707-4d36-ab0e-1a206a1ad589.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-09T04:39:03.901213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}